OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with a band
OL,6,Fof light rain and drizzle edging south
OL,7,Fand east across the region. Possibly
OL,8,Fturning a little brighter and drier in
OL,9,Fthe north later. Cooler than on
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny rain across the south
OL,13,Fwill soon move away during the
OL,14,Fevening, leaving a dry and clear night
OL,15,Ffor many. A chilly night unfolding
OL,16,Faway from coasts with misty patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
