OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA bright start to the
OL,6,Fweekend with sunny spells, mostly in
OL,7,Fthe south. The odd shower possible
OL,8,Fwith some brisker winds in the north.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,12,Fwindier on Sunday with heavy rain
OL,13,Farriving, clearing later. Sunny
OL,14,Fperiods on Monday, before becoming wet
OL,15,Fand windy again on Tuesday.
OL,16,FTemperatures remaining above average,
OL,17,Fand warmest on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
